sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Worker on WhatsApp
    participant AS as Assistant surface
    participant KS as Tenant AI control
    participant RT as Router
    participant TL as Tool layer
    participant EN as Engine ledger
    participant CK as Chokepoint
    participant MP as Model provider
    participant GS as Interceptor and guardrails
    participant AU as India log and disclosure store
    W->>AS: Hindi message asking how much PF was deducted this month
    AS->>W: Re-authenticates the person on the shared handset
    AS->>KS: Reads the tenant switch and the UC-Q3 feature state
    KS-->>AS: ON, UC-Q3 enabled
    AS->>RT: Query class, cheap tier, eligible providers only
    RT->>TL: get_payslip scoped to the authenticated worker
    TL->>EN: Reads the computed ledger for the month
    EN-->>TL: Gross 50,000, EPF wages 15,000, employee PF 1,800
    TL-->>RT: Typed fields plus the member UAN
    RT->>CK: Envelope with typed fields and the worker message
    CK->>CK: UAN dropped by the UC-Q3 manifest, name tokenised, message clean
    CK->>MP: Tokenised prompt with the engine figures as grounded facts
    MP-->>CK: Draft says PF is 12 percent of 50,000, which is 6,000
    CK->>CK: Response scanned, name token rehydrated for this worker only
    CK->>GS: Draft handed to the post-generation checks
    GS->>EN: Cross-checks 50,000 and 12 percent and 6,000 against ledger and store
    GS-->>AS: 6,000 blocked, engine value 1,800 substituted with its basis line
    AS->>W: Hindi answer, 1,800 in Western Arabic digits, rule citation attached
    CK->>AU: Tokenised prompt and blocked draft logged in India
    GS->>AU: Interceptor block recorded as a quality event
    CK->>AU: One disclosure record for this worker
